        name = "Frosty Flying Carpet",
        mountCategory = "Other",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Raise Northrend Tailoring and gather the required cloth, gems or Frozen Orbs for a personal craft.\n\n1. Learn Northrend Tailoring from Charles Worth in original Dalaran (36.5, 33.5), then raise the skill to 60 for the carpet recipe. Legion Dalaran is not the destination for this pattern.\n\n2. Gather at least 10 Frozen Orbs. You can buy them or loot the final bosses of eligible Wrath Heroic dungeons; six will be spent on the recipe and four are actual crafting reagents.\n\n3. Find Frozo the Renowned outdoors in Dalaran's Magus Commerce Exchange (40.0, 28.3). Buy Pattern: Frosty Flying Carpet for six Frozen Orbs and learn it on your tailor. If the pattern is hidden, check your profession and vendor filters.\n\n4. Obtain one Ebonweave, one Moonshroud, and one Spellweave, and keep four Frozen Orbs for the craft. These are the three finished specialty cloths; there is no need to visit old attunement altars or wait for their original Wrath cooldowns.\n\n5. Craft and use Frosty Flying Carpet on that tailor. The finished item is bind on pickup. Keep Northrend Tailoring learned to ride it, even though the collection unlock is shared with your account.",
